<title>USA: CCC buys 7,000 tonnes of HRW wheat for Kyrgyzstan.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 7,000 tonnes of HRW wheat for Kyrgyzstan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 7,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat for shipment to Kyrgyzstan from Farmland Industries for $181.47 a tonne FOB Galveston, Texas.</p>
<p>The wheat is for shipment between October 15 and November 10.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
